systems malfunction regularly, and unrest among Class-D personnel places additional strain on site operations.\n\nIn the present year, 2014, \"PHOENIX\" remains active, operating on borrowed time.\n\nWhere will you fit into the facility?\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nPlayers begin as Class-D personnel, to join the Foundation as staff or security, you must apply for Level - 0 in the application center.\n\n","path":"/game/84833009650751-scp-phoenix","slug":"84833009650751-scp-phoenix","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ec39ff1b12a2d1ed78f115024d5cf27558459f2afb532ee38b80d6bb52d45a8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-21f0e95041f5272d37ce20b3cdfbed1c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1234143,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T08:04:02.538Z","creator":{"name":"SCP:F ~ Special Containment Procedures Foundation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":110270650260695,"name":"[🐟] Fisch","desc":"🦈 Welcome to Fisch 🦈\n\nDive into Fisch, the ultimate fishing adventure where exploration and progression are yours to control. Cast your line to catch rare and unique fish, each with 400,000+ possible variations. Explore a growing world with your trusty rod, and maybe even reel in some new friends along the way!\n\n[How To Fish]\n• Hold down [LMB] to cast your bobber\n• Await a bite. You can \"shake\" your rod to attract fish faster\n• When you have a bite, hold down or click [LMB] to pull the bar white bar. Follow the blue line to the best of your ability; it's okay to mess up a few times!\n• When the progress bar on the bottom is full, you'll reel in your catch!\n\nCurrent Version • • 1.04.0\n\nCredits:\n*Developer: @WoozyNate\n*Music: @AZALI00013 & @0hkkei (YT)\n*& Special Thanks To All Testers!\n\nInspired By; Refinery Caves, Stardew Valley","path":"/game/110270650260695-fisch","slug":"110270650260695-fisch","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game